return {
	["Oohh, from Arnie? For sure, he is so handsome. I will spray them with my perfumes. Greet him from me and take this necklace."] = "Ooo, dla Arniego? Pewnie, on jest taki przystojny. Jeszcze popsikam swoimi perfumami. Pozdrow go ode mnie i trzymaj naszyjnik.",
	["I'm not able to make any necklace out of that.."] = "No z tego nie uplote takiego naszyjnika.",
	["Thank you! Wooah, and it even smells nice. Madame Malkin did a great job. Take this as your reward."] = "Dziekuje ci! Oooo i nawet ladnie pachnie, Madame Malkin wykonala kawal swietnej roboty. Wez to w podziece.",
	["Of course I have a mission for you. You will become the soldier of MirkoTown, like I am.\nRecently, I have heard rumors of some illegal business conduted in a bandit village. Someone has not gotten fucked around for a long time.\nCheck it out, the village is to the east. Apparently they are smuggling using their basement tunnels."] = "Oczywiscie, ze mam dla ciebie misje. Zostaniesz straznikiem z MirkoTown, tak jak ja.\nOstatnio dochodza mnie sluchy o jakichs nielegalnych interesach w wiosce bandytow. Ktos chyba dawno nie dostal z polobrotu.\nSprawdz to, wioska znajduje sie na wschodzie. Podobno prowadza przemyt w swoich podziemiach.",
	["You managed to get in there, great. Hmm, but what's this language? I think that I know someone that will be able to translate it.\nYou should ask my close friend Shivganesh, who works in Prince Kebab in Hurghada."] = "Udalo ci sie wtargnac tam, niezle. Ale co to za jezyk? Wydaje mi sie znajomy i wiem kto bedzie umial go przetlumaczyc.\nPodpytaj mojego znajomego, ktory pracuje w Prince Kebab w Hurghadzie.",
	["Ah that's really simple. I will write down the translation on this piece of paper. Say hi to Walker from me."] = "A to bardzo proste, zapisze ci na tym skrawku tlumaczenie i pozdrow odemnie Walkera.",
	["Thats very intereseting. From what Shivganesh wrote here, it would seem that they made some deal with the dwarves from the lignite mines. Hmm.. looks like they they sold them the legendary dragon scale legs. Investigate this, but be careful, as dwarves are much stronger than humans."] = "Bardzo intewresuajce. Z tego co nakreslil Shivganesh, doszlo do jakiegos dilu z krasnoludami z kopalni wegla brunatnego. Jesli to co czytam jest zgodne z prawda, to w gre wchodza legendarne nogawice ze smoczej luski. Badz ostrozny, te kransoludy sa bardzo niebezpieczne!",
	["Help Commissioner Fisher first, I cant trust you now."] = "Najpierw pomoz Komisarzowi Rybie, na te chwile nie jestem w stanie ci zaufac.",
	["Great."] = "Wspaniale.",
	["Thats awesome! Only if I knew how to make a necklace of that.. Please, find someone that will be able to weave one of those teeths. I would be really greateful."] = "Wooow, swietne. Tylko jak ja teraz to zszyje w naszyjnik.. Znajdz prosze osobe, ktora z tych zebow uplecie naszyjnik. Bede bardzo wdzieczny.",
	["I have ordered a special bow from the Elves to make my dominando.\nHowever, I could not go there. Could you please get it and bring it to me?"] = "Zamowilem u elfow specjalny luk, zebym mogl robic swoje Dominando.",
	["Keep this special bow created with my elvish magic"] = "Trzymaj ten specjalny luk, stworzony dzieki magii elfow. I pozdrow Kitza.",
	["To craft this bow I'll need a lyre, 3 holy orchids, a red rose and a rope."] = "Aby wytworzyc luk potrzebuje liry, 3 swiete kwiaty orchidei, czerwonej rozy oraz zwyklej liny.",
	["Is that THIS bow? Guess I got played by the elves. I will make them regret..\nBut thanks, you finished your mission. Here, keep my old bow in return."] = "To jest ten luk? Chyba mnie te elfy w chuja zrobily, zrobie im takie Dominando...\nAle dzieki, wypelniles swoja misje, trzymaj w podziece moj poprzedni luk.",
	["Mission? I would love to go on some mission, like Schwarzenegger did. He was the man. Do you think that I look as jacked as he did?\nIf you want to help me, you can do me a favour. Unfortunately, I can't leave this place and I miss a few things to become even a more badass.\nI always wanted to show off with my teeth necklace. I need 3 orc teeth, 3 rotworm teeth and maybe some of the vampire. Would you get them for me?"] = "Misja? Sam bym pojechal na jakas misje, jak Schwarzenegger. On to byl gosc, wygladam tez tak pakersko jak on?\nJesli chcesz mi pomoc, to mozesz wyswiadczyc dla mnie przysluge. Nie moge sie stad ruszyc, a brakuje mi paru rzeczy, by byc jeszcze wiekszym kozakiem.\nZawsze chcialem przyszpanowac zebowym naszyjnikiem. Potrzebowal bym do niego z 5 zebow orkow, 5 rotwormowych i moze jakies wampirze. Zdobedziesz je dla mnie?",
	["Looks like they have been scammed. You can keep those legs, and please this hat as your reward. I'll whisper a word about you to the Commissioner."] = "Wyglada na to ze krasnoludy zostaly oszukane i to na dosc powazna kwote. Oto twoja nagroda za zakonczenie tej sprawy. A spodnie mozesz sobie zachowac.",
	["Far to the west there is small village called Knurowo. You need to be aware of elves and bandits if you want to go there. To the south west there is main farm of our town, and some hills inhabited by amazons and goblins to the north."] = "Tam? Tam jest w sumie knurow, ostatnio jakiegos sebixa tam zabili. Poza tym jakis swir z bialym jeleniem. Wedrujac do Knurowa musisz uwazac na elfow oraz bandytow.",
	["I need to finally lose weight. I heard that somewhere to the south, witches grow huge carrots that help with slimming. ...\nYou should leave MirkoTown through the southern gate and then head to the swamps. That's where you should find those carrots. Just bring me one."] = "Musze w koncu schudnac. Podobno gdzies na poludniu, za bagnami wiedzmy hoduja ogromne marchewki, dobre na odchudzanie. ...\nMozna tam dojsc z poludniowej bramy, po prostu przynies mi kawalek.",
	["Help Commissioner Fisher first. I cant trust you now."] = "Najpierw pomoz Komisarzowi Rybie, na te chwile nie jestem w stanie ci zaufac.",
	["Arrgh, that's gross! I definitely prefer hamburgers, but well, take this lump of chocolate dough. I tried to make a chocolate cake, but something went wrong. Also take my old knight legs, I don't fit in them anymore anyway."] = "Fuuu, niedobre. Wole jednak hamburgery, trzymaj to ciasto. Probowalem zrobic tort czekoladowy, ale cos mi nie wyszlo. Masz tez moje stare spodnie, i tak sie w nie nie mieszcze.",
	["Come back when you reach 20 level!"] = "Zglos sie po nagrode po zdobyciu 20 poziomu!",
	["Thats some fake one."] = "To jakas oszukana marchew.",
	["Come back with eco carrot."] = "Wroc jesli zdobedziesz eko marchew.",
	--Questlog
	["To Carry the Pigs"] = "Na pomoc Bagietom",
	["To be like the Schwarzenegger"] = "Byc jak Schwarzenegger",
	["Arni asks you to collect the following items: 5 orc tooth, 5 carrion worm fangs, and 1 vampire teeth."] = "Zbierz dla arniego 3 zeby orka, 3 kly rotworma oraz zab wampira.",
	["Arni glanced at these teeth, and asked you to find someone who can make them into necklace."] = "Arni obejrzal zeby, ale poprosil cie zebys znalazl kogos, kto zrobi z nich naszyjnik.",
	["Madame Malkin gladly made this necklace for Arni."] = "Madame Malkin z checia wykonala naszyjnik dla Arniego.",
	["In exchange for the teeth necklace, Arni gave u his old armour and a ring."] = "Arni w zamian dal ci swoj stary pancerz oraz pierscionek.",
	["Half turn Kick"] = "Kopniak z polobrotu",
	["Cordell Walker is suspecting bandits of commissioning illegal transactions in their encampment."] = "Walker ma podejrzenia, ze gdzies w wiosce bandytow sa krecone nielegalne deale.",
	["He was right. Now go to the Price Kebab and ask Shivganesh for translation."] = "Mial racje. Idz do Prince Kebab i przetlumacz List.",
	["It wasn't hard at all for Shivganesh. Take the list and translation back to Cordell Walker."] = "Wcale nie bylo to takie trudne dla Shivganesha, odnies przetlumaczony list do Walkera.",
	["You have received MirkoTown guard hat for your help."] = "W zamian za pomoc dostales Kapelusz straznika MirkoTown.",
	["A Balanced Diet"] = "Dieta Grubego Mirka",
	["Collect 1 slimming carrot for fat Mirek."] = "Znajdz odchudzajaca marchewke dla Grubego Mirka.",
	["The carrot was dogshit, and u received chocolate slush in for your effort."] = "Marchewka byla chujowa, ale dostales czekoladowa papke w zamian.",
	["Kitz's Dominando"] = "Dominando Kitza",
	["Arrange a special bow from elf abode."] = "Zalatw specjalny luk z siedziby elfow.",
	["You have received the item from Legolas. Go give it to Kitz."] = "Otrzymales luk od Legolasa, przekaz go Kitzowi.",
	["Turns out elvish bow sucks. Kitz now wishes to rook the elves. In return for your efforts you received his old bow."] = "Luk okazal sie chujowy, wiec Kitz pragnie zrobic Dominando elfom. W zamian jednak dal ci jego wlasny luk.",
